    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000003": {
      "name": "Ten minutes later, the gauge stopped",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Ten minutes later, the river gauge at Syafrubesi stopped sending.**\n\nIts last reading was **1.62 m**. The gauge sits twenty kilometres below the\nslope. It never sent again.\n\nBy **09:15** the Department of Hydrology and Meteorology had confirmed a flood\nwave. It warned people down the Trishuli. **679,295 text\nmessages** went out to phones along the river.\n\nThe warning reached everyone below the gauge. The people above it already had\nthe water.\n\n**On the map:** red dots are what was later marked destroyed\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "40%",
          "title": "Ten minutes later, the gauge stopped"
        },
        "extent": [
          9471563.03209108,
          3248207.6342882994,
          9528447.656704696,
          3290114.658272268
        ],
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "opacity": 0.25,
