    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000009": {
      "name": "The open valley, before and after",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {
            "fig-before-after-yellow.png": {
              "image/png": ""
            }
          },
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Below Bidur: the same six kilometre square, before the flood and after it.**\n\n![below Bidur, before and after](attachment:fig-before-after-yellow.png)\n\nHere the change is small: a wider, paler channel and more sand. This is the same\nflood that destroyed the gorge. Here the valley was wide enough to hold it.\n",
